sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant FE as Next.js (:3000)
    participant BE as Spring Boot (:8080)
    participant Email as Email (logged)

    User->>FE: Click "Bật MFA" on Profile page
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/users/mfa/setup
    BE->>BE: Generate 6-digit OTP, hash with BCrypt
    BE->>BE: Save MfaChallenge (userId, type=SETUP, expiresAt)
    BE->>Email: Send OTP to user's email
    BE-->>FE: { message: "OTP sent" }
    FE->>FE: Show OTP input form
    FE-->>User: "Mã OTP đã gửi đến email"

    User->>FE: Enter 6-digit OTP
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/users/mfa/verify { code }
    BE->>BE: Find MfaChallenge (type=SETUP)
    BE->>BE: Validate OTP (not expired, attempts < 5)
    BE->>BE: user.mfaEnabled = true
    BE->>BE: Generate 10 recovery codes (8-char alphanumeric)
    BE->>BE: Hash each with BCrypt, save to recovery_codes table
    BE-->>FE: { recoveryCodes: ["AB12CD34", "EF56GH78", ...] }

    FE->>FE: Display recovery codes in monospace grid
    FE-->>User: "Lưu các mã khôi phục này"

    User->>FE: Click "Đã lưu"
    FE->>FE: Clear recovery codes from view
    FE-->>User: MFA enabled ✓
